# Nova plugin bundle — ed25519 signing public key
#
# Algorithm: ed25519. The value below is the raw 32-byte public key,
# lowercase hex (64 chars).
#
# The matching PRIVATE key is held only as the GitHub Actions repo secret
# `NOVA_PLUGIN_SIGNING_KEY` (an openssl ed25519 PEM), used by the
# `plugin-manifest` job in .github/workflows/release.yml to sign
# nova-plugin-v<version>.tar.gz — the signature is published as the
# nova-plugin-v<version>.tar.gz.sig sidecar on each GitHub Release (raw
# 64-byte ed25519 signature over the exact bundle bytes, hex-encoded).
#
# This file is committed for transparency/reference only — it is NOT the
# trust root bamboo actually uses. bamboo ships this same key baked into
# its default trusted-publishers store, so installing an official signed
# Nova release needs no extra flags. Publishing it here just lets anyone
# cross-check "the key bamboo trusts for nova" against what this repo's own
# release pipeline signs with.

